IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sgh-constitution`

-- Tests for sgh-constitution.l4 (s 22). Every expected value is written from the text of the section, beside the assertion, before the run.

§ `s 22(1): what the constitution must state`
-- (test alias a22a = `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter`)
-- arguments: the matter; the kind of company
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(a) the name of the company` `limited by shares` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "(a) the name of the company"
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(a) the name of the company` `unlimited` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "(a)" applies to every company
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(b) that the liability of the members is limited` `limited by shares` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "(b) if the company is a company limited by shares -- that the liability of the members is limited"
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(b) that the liability of the members is limited` `limited by guarantee` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not a company limited by shares: an "if" gate unmet on a duty (marginal reading (a))
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(b) that the liability of the members is limited` `limited by shares and by guarantee` EQUALS NOTHING   -- a company limited both by shares and by guarantee is not named
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(c) that the liability of the members is limited and that each member undertakes to contribute to the assets of the company in the event of its being wound up` `limited by guarantee` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "(c) if the company is a company limited by guarantee"
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(c) that the liability of the members is limited and that each member undertakes to contribute to the assets of the company in the event of its being wound up` `limited by shares` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not a company limited by guarantee: an "if" gate unmet
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(c) that the liability of the members is limited and that each member undertakes to contribute to the assets of the company in the event of its being wound up` `limited by shares and by guarantee` EQUALS NOTHING   -- not named
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(d) that the liability of the members is unlimited` `unlimited` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "(d) if the company is an unlimited company"
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(d) that the liability of the members is unlimited` `limited by shares` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not an unlimited company: an "if" gate unmet
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(d) that the liability of the members is unlimited` `limited by shares and by guarantee` EQUALS NOTHING   -- not named
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(e) the number of members with which the company is applying to be registered` `unlimited` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "(e) if the company is an unlimited company or a company limited by guarantee"
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(e) the number of members with which the company is applying to be registered` `limited by guarantee` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the other kind in (e)
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(e) the number of members with which the company is applying to be registered` `limited by shares` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- a company limited by shares: an "if" gate unmet
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(e) the number of members with which the company is applying to be registered` `limited by shares and by guarantee` EQUALS NOTHING   -- not named
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(f) the full names, addresses and occupations of the subscribers to the constitution of the company` `limited by shares` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "(f) the full names, addresses and occupations of the subscribers"
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1)(g) that the subscribers are desirous of being formed into a company in pursuance of the constitution` `unlimited` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "(g) that such subscribers are desirous of being formed into a company"
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution must state the matter` `s 22(1) another matter` `limited by shares` EQUALS NOTHING   -- "in addition to other requirements": the others are prescribed elsewhere (includes)
-- (test alias a22b = `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met`)
-- arguments (12): the kind; prescribed requirements met; dated; states the name; states the liability is limited; states each member undertakes to contribute; states the liability is unlimited; states the number of members; states the subscribers' names, addresses and occupations; states they are desirous; the company is to have a share capital; states they agree to take shares
#ASSERT `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met` `limited by shares` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS TRUE   -- a company limited by shares with a share capital: everything it must state
#ASSERT `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met` `limited by shares` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE   -- "(where the company is to have a share capital) respectively agree to take the number of shares": not stated
#ASSERT `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met` `limited by shares` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE   -- no share capital: the agreement to take shares is not required
#ASSERT `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met` `limited by shares` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE   -- "(b)": the liability is not stated to be limited
#ASSERT `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met` `limited by shares` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE   -- does not comply with the prescribed requirements
#ASSERT `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met` `limited by shares` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE   -- "must be dated": not dated
#ASSERT `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met` `limited by shares` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE   -- "(a)": no name
#ASSERT `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met` `limited by shares` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE   -- "(f)": the subscribers' details are not stated
#ASSERT `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met` `limited by shares` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE   -- "(g)": not stated that the subscribers are desirous
#ASSERT `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met` `limited by guarantee` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE   -- a company limited by guarantee: limited, each member undertakes to contribute, and the number of members stated
#ASSERT `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met` `limited by guarantee` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE   -- "(c)": no undertaking to contribute stated
#ASSERT `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met` `limited by guarantee` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE   -- "(c)": not stated to be limited
#ASSERT `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met` `limited by guarantee` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE   -- "(e)": the number of members is not stated
#ASSERT `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met` `unlimited` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE   -- an unlimited company: the liability is unlimited and the number of members stated
#ASSERT `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met` `unlimited` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE   -- "(d)": not stated to be unlimited
#ASSERT `s 22(1) every requirement that applies to the company is met` `unlimited` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE   -- "(e)": the number of members is not stated
-- (test alias a22c = `s 22(1) the constitution complies with the subsection`)
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution complies with the subsection` `limited by shares` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- as above: complies
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution complies with the subsection` `limited by shares` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not dated: a duty not fully met (marginal reading (a))
#ASSERT `s 22(1) the constitution complies with the subsection` `limited by shares and by guarantee` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- a company limited both by shares and by guarantee: the paragraphs name no requirement

§ `s 22(1AA) and (1AB)`
-- (test alias a22d = `s 22(1AA) the company must lodge with the Registrar a notice of the change`)
-- arguments: the kind of company; the company changes the number of its members with which it is registered
#ASSERT `s 22(1AA) the company must lodge with the Registrar a notice of the change` `unlimited` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "a company to which subsection (1)(e) applies": an unlimited company
#ASSERT `s 22(1AA) the company must lodge with the Registrar a notice of the change` `limited by guarantee` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- a company limited by guarantee
#ASSERT `s 22(1AA) the company must lodge with the Registrar a notice of the change` `limited by guarantee` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no change: a duty whose "where" gate is unmet (marginal reading (a))
#ASSERT `s 22(1AA) the company must lodge with the Registrar a notice of the change` `limited by shares` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- a company limited by shares: the text says nothing
-- (test alias a22e = `s 22(1AA) the company lodged the notice of the change in time`)
-- arguments: the date of the change; the date the notice was lodged
#ASSERT `s 22(1AA) the company lodged the notice of the change in time` (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 15 5 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "within 14 days after the occurrence of such change": 1 May plus 14 days is 15 May
#ASSERT `s 22(1AA) the company lodged the notice of the change in time` (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the day of the change is in time (fork line F-H-P2)
#ASSERT `s 22(1AA) the company lodged the notice of the change in time` (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 16 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- one day late: a period the text fixes in its own words (periods ruling (a))
#ASSERT `s 22(1AA) the company lodged the notice of the change in time` (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 30 4 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- before the change: not "after" it
-- (test alias a22f = `s 22(1AB) the company or officer in default is guilty of an offence`)
-- arguments: default is made by the company in complying with (1AA); the person is the company or an officer in default
#ASSERT `s 22(1AB) the company or officer in default is guilty of an offence` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "the company and every officer of the company who is in default shall each be guilty of an offence"
#ASSERT `s 22(1AB) the company or officer in default is guilty of an offence` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- an officer not in default: an element unmet (split site (i))
#ASSERT `s 22(1AB) the company or officer in default is guilty of an offence` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no default in complying with (1AA): an element unmet (split site (i))
-- (test alias a22g = `s 22(1AB) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction`)
#ASSERT `s 22(1AB) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST (Penalty OF 2000, 0, FALSE, TRUE)   -- "a fine not exceeding $2,000 and also to a default penalty": no imprisonment, and the default penalty is added
#ASSERT `s 22(1AB) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- not guilty: the subsection states no penalty for them
-- (test alias a22h = `s 22(1A) the provision is deemed to be deleted, insofar as it relates to those matters`)
-- arguments: then subsisting on 30 January 2006; states the amount of share capital; states the division into shares of a fixed amount
#ASSERT `s 22(1A) the provision is deemed to be deleted, insofar as it relates to those matters` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "(a) the amount of share capital with which the company proposes to be or is registered"
#ASSERT `s 22(1A) the provision is deemed to be deleted, insofar as it relates to those matters` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "(b) the division of the share capital of the company into shares of a fixed amount"
#ASSERT `s 22(1A) the provision is deemed to be deleted, insofar as it relates to those matters` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "either or both of paragraphs (a) and (b)"
#ASSERT `s 22(1A) the provision is deemed to be deleted, insofar as it relates to those matters` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- states neither: outside the class the deeming reaches, a scope limit with no "only" (periods ruling (c)); was JUST FALSE before the wave-2 reader
#ASSERT `s 22(1A) the provision is deemed to be deleted, insofar as it relates to those matters` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not subsisting on that day: a failed "on" gate (periods ruling (b))

§ `s 22(2) to (4)`
-- (test alias a22i = `s 22(2) the subscriber must make a declaration to the Registrar as to the number of shares the subscriber agrees to take`)
#ASSERT `s 22(2) the subscriber must make a declaration to the Registrar as to the number of shares the subscriber agrees to take` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "Each subscriber to the constitution must, if the company is to have a share capital, make a declaration to the Registrar"
#ASSERT `s 22(2) the subscriber must make a declaration to the Registrar as to the number of shares the subscriber agrees to take` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no share capital: an "if" gate unmet on a duty (marginal reading (a))
-- (test alias a22j = `s 22(2) the declaration is made in a way the subsection allows`)
-- arguments: made personally; made through a registered qualified individual authorised by the subscriber
#ASSERT `s 22(2) the declaration is made in a way the subsection allows` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "either personally"
#ASSERT `s 22(2) the declaration is made in a way the subsection allows` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "or through a registered qualified individual authorised by the subscriber"
#ASSERT `s 22(2) the declaration is made in a way the subsection allows` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- any other way: "either ... or" is a closed pair
-- (test alias a22k = `s 22(2) the number of shares the subscriber agrees to take is a number the subsection allows`)
#ASSERT `s 22(2) the number of shares the subscriber agrees to take is a number the subsection allows` 1 EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "(not being less than one)": exactly one
#ASSERT `s 22(2) the number of shares the subscriber agrees to take is a number the subsection allows` 5 EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- more than one
#ASSERT `s 22(2) the number of shares the subscriber agrees to take is a number the subsection allows` 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- none
-- (test alias a22l = `s 22(3) the most the member is liable to contribute`)
-- arguments: the kind of company; the constitution states that the liability of members is limited; the amount (if any) unpaid on the shares held by the member
#ASSERT `s 22(3) the most the member is liable to contribute` `limited by shares` TRUE 250 EQUALS JUST 250   -- "the liability of the members is limited to the amount (if any) unpaid on the shares respectively held by them"
#ASSERT `s 22(3) the most the member is liable to contribute` `limited by shares` TRUE 0 EQUALS JUST 0   -- nothing unpaid: "(if any)"
#ASSERT `s 22(3) the most the member is liable to contribute` `limited by shares` FALSE 250 EQUALS NOTHING   -- no such statement in the constitution: the sentence does not speak
#ASSERT `s 22(3) the most the member is liable to contribute` `limited by guarantee` TRUE 250 EQUALS NOTHING   -- a company limited by guarantee: the sentence is about a company limited by shares
-- (test alias a22m = `s 22(4) the copy of the constitution is kept as the subsection requires`)
-- arguments: duly signed by the subscribers; the company is to have a share capital; the copy states the number of shares each subscriber agreed to take; kept at the registered office
#ASSERT `s 22(4) the copy of the constitution is kept as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "duly signed by the subscribers and stating ... the number of shares that each subscriber has agreed to take, must be kept at the registered office of the company"
#ASSERT `s 22(4) the copy of the constitution is kept as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- no share capital: the number of shares need not be stated ("if the company is to have a share capital")
#ASSERT `s 22(4) the copy of the constitution is kept as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- share capital but the number of shares not stated
#ASSERT `s 22(4) the copy of the constitution is kept as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not duly signed
#ASSERT `s 22(4) the copy of the constitution is kept as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not kept at the registered office

§ `Regulative rules of s 22`
-- s 22(1AA): within 14 days after the change (the day of the change is time 0); the consequence the text states is the offence of s 22(1AB).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 22(1AA) rule: the company's duty to lodge a notice of the change in the number of members` (Company "Acme Pte Ltd") AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 22(1AA) lodge with the Registrar a notice of the change in the number of members in the prescribed form` AT 14
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 22(1AA) rule: the company's duty to lodge a notice of the change in the number of members` (Company "Acme Pte Ltd") AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 22(1AA) lodge with the Registrar a notice of the change in the number of members in the prescribed form` AT 15
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 22(1AA) rule: the company's duty to lodge a notice of the change in the number of members` (Company "Acme Pte Ltd") AT 0 WITH
    (`WAITUNTIL` 15)
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 22(1AA) rule: the company's duty to lodge a notice of the change in the number of members` (Company "Acme Pte Ltd") AT 0 WITH
-- s 22(2): no time limit and no consequence stated, so no breach path.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 22(2) rule: the subscriber's duty to make a declaration of the number of shares` (Individual "Priya") AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "Priya" DOES `s 22(2) make a declaration to the Registrar as to the number of shares the subscriber agrees to take` AT 900
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 22(2) rule: the subscriber's duty to make a declaration of the number of shares` (Individual "Priya") AT 0 WITH
